101
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,520
You look at the office.

102
00:03:34,100 --> 00:03:34,740
Forty people.

103
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,900
Half of them are asleep at their desks

104
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:37,880
