107
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,980
"You look like you've seen a ghost."

108
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:46,640
"I've seen a deadline."

109
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:48,060
"Well, it's mine.

110
00:03:48,300 --> 00:03:49,300
