120
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:03,680
It's a ratio.

121
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,600
It's a work thing."

122
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,980
She looks at you for a long second.

123
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,100
Then she goes back to her three monitors,

124
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:11,900
