127
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:16,280
Fast.

128
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:19,500
There's a second part of his technique, called

129
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:20,140
Collapse.

130
00:04:21,020 --> 00:04:23,040
It applies the seven-three line to the environment

131
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:25,000
