145
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:53,260
Lesson one: a weak point isn't a trick.

146
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,500
It's a responsibility.

147
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:57,340
You mark the stairwell's glass wall with chalk,

148
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:59,620
