188
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:20,940
You clock back in.

189
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,660
You don't have a choice anymore.

190
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:26,300
In the story, once overtime starts, his power

191
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:26,680
