211
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,720
Five minutes left.

212
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:09,960
The curse hits first.

213
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:11,580
You go through a wall.

214
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,640
You feel a rib, or something near a

215
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,740
rib, say no.

216
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,780
Your technique keeps the lines steady, though.

217
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:20,600
Three tenths from the top.

218
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:22,280
Three tenths from the top.

219
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:24,240
Always three tenths.

220
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:26,720
Our guess is that a fight like this

221
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,820
