228
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:41,720
Nothing.

229
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:45,180
The curse laughs, with a hundred clock voices.

230
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,700
You aren't aiming at its chest.

231
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,920
You're aiming at the place it hides its

232
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,460
